add(N,"entry:32","error","The Crystal Palace dates should be given as positions. In the OCR scan the diary's first account of the Crystal Palace ('In the afternoon we mounted our carriage and drove to the Crystal Palace') comes after the 29 June header, and no 30 June (4th) header is legible. Burne gives 30 June. The diary records a second visit under Thursday 7th (3rd July), so 'asks to go back' says more than the text.",{"date_display":"30 June 1873 per Burne (in the diary scan the passage follows the 29 June header; no 30 June header is legible); second visit Thursday 7 Jumada I (3 July 1873)","text_replace":{"old":"he asks to go back a second time","new":"he went back for a second visit on 3 July"},"source_note":"Redhouse tr., The Diary of H.M. the Shah of Persia (Murray, 1874), chapter 4 (passage after the Sunday 3rd/29th June header; second visit under Thursday 7th/3rd July); Burne, Memories (1907), ch. IX gives 30 June"},"approx")
